   "fieldname": "help_html",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-radius:6px;\">\n  <strong>🧮 Job Requisition Form Settings</strong><br>\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0;\">\n    <li>The external Job Requisition form renders from the <strong>Job Requisition DocType</strong> automatically — same fields, tabs, sections and mandatory rules.</li>\n    <li>Add a row below <strong>only</strong> for a field you want to change: hide it, force mandatory/optional, relabel, regroup, or restrict child-table columns.</li>\n    <li>No row for a field = it follows the doctype exactly.</li>\n    <li>Turn on <strong>Show Only Configured Fields</strong> to render ONLY the fields you list below (strict allowlist) instead of the whole doctype.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
